roduction today he says none of them  would exist without the Goliath it was  the first truly reliable and low-priced  vehicle for German tradesmen and in a  sense the ancestor the VW Golf he has no  doubt that Goliath f 400 is a milestone  in automotive history one question  remains why did walk by and pick the  name of an outsize biblical warrior for  a minivan was it a marketing move or  massive confidence or just wishful  thinking  you
 

